{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1000_p", "source_sha256": "54bd07e6f0093ef2dcddfab91592ee6b8e27b182c45e0607fd4457faf835ffb5", "ja": "（『MASTERS OF IDOL WORLD』がいよいよ始ま\nる！　PRライブも話題になってるし、準備は万端だ）", "zh": "（『MASTERS OF IDOL WORLD』终于要开始了！宣传演出也引发了话题，准备工作万无一失）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0016053c73e0e481a73254dc73bf6fbdcb75ab0035ba55c66f1ae73eaad49e22", "ja": "イェ～イ♪　……うーん、なんか違うかも？\nえっと……こうかな？　あ、これこれ♪", "zh": "耶～♪……嗯——总觉得有点不对？\n那个……这样吗？啊，就是这个♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1002_p", "source_sha256": "28d167991f818c014c3b392e1ab127a8aba6d29b86eb4ef7bef3b8b28ae22d0d", "ja": "あれ？　翼、お疲れさま。\nもうスタンバイしてるのか。早いな！", "zh": "哎？翼，辛苦了。\n已经准备就绪了吗？真早啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7a3cdd914090e7172b41fe2a7f14f95277971849ab97aee8e4d76ffd67832715", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！　スタンバイ\nじゃなくて、他の子達のリハを見てただけですよ♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！我不是在待机，只是在看其他女孩子们彩排而已哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "949c0b1deda97ea8cf0bedb3d1caa97f3735af6e98fd28a4ea45970e556e876a", "ja": "カワイイ子とか、カッコイイ子がいっぱいで！\nすっごく楽しいでーす♪", "zh": "可爱的孩子、帅气的孩子有好多！\n真的特别开心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7778ad22b68a81e119d5ed82a3d5683b2967746d6ebed540ecb755f763e3e874", "ja": "そういうことか。\nまあ、それはそれで刺激になりそうだな。", "zh": "原来是这么回事。\n不过，那样也会很有刺激性吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "45ca5a8830366784945b224d029b0f063d6ff15ee81d70a3e57fc36114eb5522", "ja": "そうなんですよ～！　さっきの子のポーズも、\nすっごくカワイくて！", "zh": "就是这样哦～！刚才那个女孩的姿势也特别可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ae76b49f92f8180a24e22907dddd10a7af9a3dd26ecdc3f6ea003d88bcfd0f82", "ja": "なんかイメージ湧いちゃったから、わたしのダンスも\nアレンジしてみたんでーす♪　変えてもいいですか？", "zh": "因为突然有了灵感，我也试着编排了一下自己的舞蹈♪可以改动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6fdc88feba5630de4a2293fa6128cf6bcd9f114a12903fd0ab6d469a6944e42d", "ja": "え？　今からダンスを変更？　\nうーん……。いや、やってみるか！", "zh": "诶？现在要改舞蹈？\n嗯……那就试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "46ad46134c9e56a8aafc48a5e722cc1a9f8935ae8902172b807a2bb436bfc07f", "ja": "いいの！？　やった～！", "zh": "可以吗！？太好啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b8d4e805c6dbfd5ab53e60ea13647b6869e9f6edcb0f0e51f3de425913f6f1ca", "ja": "せっかくの大舞台だから、悔いのないようにな！\nせっかくだから、未来や静香にも、教えてあげてくれ。", "zh": "难得有这么大的舞台，可别留下遗憾啊！\n既然机会难得，也去教教未来和静香吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "326e75a91c7a3e624f698d883f0990576be379d4218d01b64513a07d5189a2df", "ja": "え～。どうしても教えなきゃダメ？", "zh": "诶～一定要教吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6985da4eaa3207bac11832de053ed750ddf6766b8d168ba8c3bcd34c2fec6f5b", "ja": "えっ？　えっと、イヤなのか？", "zh": "诶？呃……你不愿意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9766c262c30757fddbe710511702476d11101abd3a6a7b0beed9a659747070f8", "ja": "だって～。ふたりとも、最近すっごくカワイイんだも\nん。せっかくわたしが思いついたのに～。", "zh": "可是～因为你们两个最近都特别可爱嘛。我好不容易才想出来的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5061726965b91e8db3f617c81ef6ace3016711c409e8cd8353b3af4a52605fa0", "ja": "そうか……なるほどな。よし！　じゃあマネするのは\n禁止で、こう変えるよってことだけ教えてあげてくれ。", "zh": "这样啊……原来如此。好！那就禁止模仿，你只要告诉我准备改成什么样就行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f543b75055511883d19a28ed88efd4b3e29d286b78146530bd3ddf1628a7f5a8", "ja": "？　一緒のアレンジにしないのに、\n教えてあげるの？", "zh": "？明明不做成一样的编排，却要告诉我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1016_p", "source_sha256": "bf74c1ffdeb7e752d0091132d98b0fd1f47a3e72453818b4522dc20a14c04eda", "ja": "ああ、本番でビックリされても困るし。\nそれに、翼も他の子のポーズを参考にしたんだろ？", "zh": "嗯，要是正式演出时被吓一跳也不好办。再说，翼你不也是参考了其他女孩子的姿势吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9ae6d9026a5e44a006c2ae555d91162fdfc348842dd9cb3dc216ad9cc7ae8085", "ja": "む～……、わかりました。じゃあトクベツに、\n教えてあげちゃいますけど～、その代わり！", "zh": "唔～……好吧。那我就破例\n告诉你吧～不过作为交换！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0233_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0f1a9d9402b4b9a488f3704cebc3eefafedd76b37b9f9a0e72a800da66caea91", "ja": "本番ではわたしのアレンジ、一番に見てくれなくちゃ\nイヤですからね～？　えへへ、約束っ♪", "zh": "正式演出时，你可一定要第一个来看我的改编哦～？不然我会不高兴的。嘿嘿，约好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
